# A directory demo ships the artefact a reader is meant to run — demo 06's
# `c64 package ... -o demos/invaders/invaders.d64` is the last step of its
# own prompt. Keep those two beside the sources; every other build output
# (including the .lbl) stays ignored.
!demos/*/*.prg
!demos/*/*.d64

scratch/
docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
books/
